OL,5,G2325 TikTok: Murder Gone Viral
OL,6,     FA look at the case of American
OL,7,     Finfluencer Alexis Sharkey, who was
OL,8,     Fdeclared missing in November 2020
OL,9,     Fby her husband Thomas Sharkey.
OL,10,     FWhen her body was found on a side
OL,11,     Froad by a truck driver shortly
OL,12,     Fafter, detectives began an
OL,13,     Finvestigation that led to her
OL,14,     Fspouse. However, just two weeks
OL,15,     Fafter the body was found, he also
OL,16,     Fdisappeared without trace
